  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Taking shelter at Kawada's apartment, the young hostess hears her terrified mother begging outside the door to start over together. That night, Toshi tells her to think of her own happiness—and wakes up to find her gone.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "ここに娘来なかったかい？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "母さん、組のヤツらに殺されちまうってんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "もう一度あの子に会いたいんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "どこから間違ったかなんか思い出せないけど、腐っても娘なんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "もう一度親子二人で、一からやり直したいんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "またババアのこと考えてんのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おい、お前はお前の幸せ考えろよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "幸せって、人それぞれじゃない？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "一緒に逃げて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "トシ、やっぱ向いてなかったね、ヤクザには。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "俺行くわ。あいつもいなくなったしよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "じゃあな、川田。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "ここに娘来なかったかい？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Didn't my daughter come by here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "母さん、組のヤツらに殺されちまうってんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Her mother is going to get killed by the yakuza!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "もう一度あの子に会いたいんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just want to see that girl one more time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "どこから間違ったかなんか思い出せないけど、腐っても娘なんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I can't even remember where things went wrong, but no matter what, she's still my daughter.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "もう一度親子二人で、一からやり直したいんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want the two of us, mother and daughter, to start over from scratch.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "またババアのこと考えてんのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you thinking about your old lady again?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おい、お前はお前の幸せ考えろよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey—you need to think about your own happiness.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "幸せって、人それぞれじゃない？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Isn't happiness different for every person?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "一緒に逃げて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Run away together with me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "トシ、やっぱ向いてなかったね、ヤクザには。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Toshi... you really weren't cut out to be a yakuza after all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "俺行くわ。あいつもいなくなったしよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm heading out. She's gone now anyway.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "じゃあな、川田。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'See you around, Kawada.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
